#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:5
#: 120c624b56c749a99c7e2a9d46e45b04 41b374853e5745b9843c2a697b2bdf9a
#: c04d623549c4439e90776194bcab3787 cfc53c8f678a41f8835eeaf0f98b14ae
msgid "MatekSys Optical Flow 3901-L0X"
msgstr "MatekSys 光流传感器 3901-L0X"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:9
#: 373899b1a4f74f3da34cf4bf76004746 5c9aa83f30c149d1ae5b15901b0b96c8
#: 63ff63dc191a4225a26ff0ef35dcf0e3 77706a2150a84ddf84a0d224e37db9e1
msgid ""
"The `MatekSys optical flow 3901-L0X sensor "
"<http://www.mateksys.com/?portfolio=3901-l0x>`__ is a lightweight optical "
"flow sensor including a short range lidar which uses the MSP protocol to "
"communicate with the autopilot.  This can be used to improve horizontal "
"position control especially in GPS denied environments."
msgstr ""
"`MatekSys 光流传感器 3901-L0X <http://www.mateksys.com/?portfolio=3901-l0x>`__ "
"是一款轻量级光流传感器，内置短程激光雷达，使用 MSP 协议与飞控通信。可用于改善水平位置控制，尤其适用于 GPS 拒止环境。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:17
#: 096f877df05a4609b48ca507030e9536 596a5a5df9434545ad05be2cd7d57f69
#: 95e2f005014c4321af808184c325d793 df3cb493b39c4135a14f08cce6ba8478
msgid ""
"The lidar included with the sensor is very short range especially outdoors."
"  We strongly recommend using a :ref:`longer range lidar instead <common-"
"rangefinder-landingpage>`."
msgstr ""
"传感器内置的激光雷达量程非常短，室外尤为明显。强烈建议使用 :ref:`量程更长的激光雷达替代 <common-rangefinder-"
"landingpage>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:20
#: 32a55bfb73b3431d8207831047a66095 434f8597c5014bd1b2bd49d50e4a985d
#: 6fe7e617f1594357a6b85eb4cbcd9a27 9de5fed4af7448c79b336ca6a0694e19
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:22
#: 2fbacb974fda4c46836d5cee0b9c4129 484753f1fbba43bfb275f68d89065b99
#: 7f28f10407434af09001cabdc56fd769 c33453ffc96741f48e0cd6dcbee94270
msgid ""
"The sensor is available from `Matekesys resellers "
"<http://www.mateksys.com/?page_id=1212>`__"
msgstr "该传感器可通过 `Mateksys 经销商 <http://www.mateksys.com/?page_id=1212>`__ 购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:25
#: 2fc1f1053ee444ac8d4df7259342499c 86f32c263bba45f99ad1287b5d37f6c6
#: a68f2db6f0b94d1cacf6d7a2cdd3fd62 c9e0c51f82024322b53d23a65fe9c9bf
msgid "Connection to Autopilot"
msgstr "与飞控的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:35
#: 04c320c2355141edadc2a56f8920eb66 24cf0a6a72584554b85ef0335dae3b29
#: 320e232017f0487cbfdf6fef34cd35e5 460d000e1e244116bcf81311d26d025a
msgid ""
"The flow sensor should be mounted on the underside of the copter with the "
"camera lens pointing downwards.  The small arrow near the camera lens should"
" be pointing forwards"
msgstr "光流传感器应安装在飞行器底部，摄像头镜头朝下。摄像头镜头附近的小箭头应指向前方"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:36
#: 9156c940517247b3b9ea59e83c3348c0 9a51e3737614420ea7bb6e7d43481c5e
#: 9abad5c8c03d485a9a4f17a3658705f3 a16b30f47ea74b7bb3d70b3bc4eb7ca6
msgid ""
"Connect the sensor to one of the autopilot's serial ports (e.g. Serial2 / "
"Telem2)"
msgstr "将传感器连接到飞控的某个串口（例如 Serial2 / Telem2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:37
#: b1ab3fe3887a4ea791492030e79f9612 b4269b736b9d463184661a2202347922
#: c1fdfe698c444fc9accb3e5393bf8ee3 db1fc98c742848528f8486ef41279cd5
msgid "Set :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` = 7 (MSP)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`FLOW_TYPE <FLOW_TYPE>` = 7（MSP）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:38
#: 31f623dac8044219b6528e28a649bd81 414a345f07b04d7c95e2e64018c4d97a
#: 5e7fb6069d2c4c8f966d137691ffa4a2 63456500abf24324abf2564a794299cd
msgid "Set :ref:`FLOW_FXSCALER <FLOW_FXSCALER>` = -800"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`FLOW_FXSCALER <FLOW_FXSCALER>` = -800"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:39
#: 007ac5d38140485bbfe567c9514820e3 0c1ef9942d314f7daf28ba55af80b223
#: 7585b914006544d892fa653d21cd58eb d069355f481f44d7982d0464a0a7e026
msgid "Set :ref:`FLOW_FYSCALER <FLOW_FYSCALER>` = -800"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`FLOW_FYSCALER <FLOW_FYSCALER>` = -800"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:40
#: 63f9c5ea34304ac58a25f2d30559679c 891de7205cc947b28e3691561a148c2f
#: 905dbfe58ec74588ac85b0bcaaada63b de0f159fc62145ff9fa095b1fae85ee8
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 32 (MSP) (assuming sensor "
"is connected to Serial2)"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 32（MSP）（假设传感器连接到 Serial2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:41
#: 3fb5eec338164c5d9d396d56d8a16e77 b4eceae7a7274cb3b36c372d2d209b6d
#: c6ceadc4fb3f4000be5ac71088cf817b f1b2b285f54841c1a20b56923f6cce0f
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 bps) (assuming sensor "
"is connected to Serial2)"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115（115200 bps）（假设传感器连接到 Serial2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:43
#: 23172e03f9214aefa9ee83c8ed61021a 789889bbc3914e1bb315eb8275773402
#: 874dc6c508d84c9f98ea3da2f29753a5 e160ceedf7e74c4194fc7d64cae4750d
msgid "To use the onboard lidar (not recommended):"
msgstr "如需使用机载激光雷达（不推荐）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:45
#: 28e880f6384242ceb1533a435585a2cf 59ec47de1cdc4c91b7a10db2ac62c6be
#: 7526cb0cbd124ecc9a32ce067eda3309 ab5040c348e94537855a419bfddda46f
msgid "Set :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 32 (MSP)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 32（MSP）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:46
#: 04d053c1d5a54742b757d82f48048113 0da5574232b54dcc8c34273d51e95ff2
#: cd17ee2d6c18486b9af61965ee4086c0 d66fea926cf24187b986bb5c06038bf5
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 1.2 to set range finder's maximum "
"range to 1.2m"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 1.2，将测距仪最大量程设为 1.2m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:49
#: 0af70dbcbf0049e9bf6ea62137b1ceb2 92c83aafae114dbea67cdc668cc01327
#: cc9a8ee992fa48a4a6656a2fe9bd3daa e61ece78a7274b63a053c18bed6bf2a1
msgid "Additional Notes"
msgstr "附加说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:51
#: 31d428c32c844334bb0131968ee05c41 6a19c33c4ad74ea3993e2a63ec45c860
#: d76f82e7b8134f89ae0906790db999d2 dc000c39f9f24cd382fee55b10069177
msgid ""
"As with all optical flow sensors, a range finder is required to use the "
"sensor for autonomous modes including :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` and "
":ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`"
msgstr ""
"与所有光流传感器一样，在使用 :ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 和 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` "
"等自主模式时，需要配合测距仪使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:52
#: 3b611298c0824df69a35f91317bc3e82 5df467eb9df443b8a97af274c6b4103a
#: 9d2cc0a549394318890e8ee2ade1b424 bf059ce0b42740d78acf58a71d3e520f
msgid ""
":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` does not require the use of a rangefinder "
"but performance is generally worse than Loiter mode and is not recommended"
msgstr ":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` 不需要测距仪，但性能通常不如 Loiter 模式，不推荐使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mateksys-optflow-3901L0X.rst:53
#: 735c55ea4eb744329eec6c31f1fdd2e4 e086fa00a75849dfae5b4efcc20146f5
#: f5f861ed25c14234914c7211f24276b8 fe05ab93ecac43cbb6aff4204081f9b9
msgid ""
"Performance can be improved by setting the :ref:`sensors position parameters"
" <common-sensor-offset-compensation>`.  For example if the sensor is mounted"
" 2cm forward and 5cm below the frame's center of rotation set "
":ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` to 0.02 and :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` to"
" 0.05."
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`传感器位置参数 <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` "
"可以提升性能。例如，若传感器安装在机架旋转中心前方 2cm、下方 5cm 处，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` 设为 "
"0.02，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` 设为 0.05。"

